        "jsCode": "let knownSimilarsOutput = $(\"All Similar\").all();\nlet knownSimilars = new Map();\nknownSimilarsOutput.forEach((nodeOutput) => {\n  knownSimilars.set(nodeOutput.json.similar.toString().trim(), nodeOutput.json.id);\n});\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  item.json.similar.forEach((similar, index) => {\n    item.json.similar[index] = knownSimilars.get(similar.toString().trim());\n  });\n}\n\nreturn $input.all();\n"
